tize any input that is used to create references to file paths. Also, enforce strict file access controls. For example, choose privileges allowing public-facing applications to access only the required files. In Java, you may also consider using a utility method such as `org.apache.commons.io.FilenameUtils.getName(...)` to only retrieve the file name from the path."},"properties":{},"ruleId":"java.servlets.security.httpservlet-path-traversal.httpservlet-path-traversal"},{"codeFlows":[{"message":{"text":"Untrusted dataflow from src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java:53 to src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java:68"},"threadFlows":[{"locations":[{"location":{"message":{"text":"Source: 'request.getCookies()' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java:53'"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java"},"region":{"endColumn":70,"endLine":53,"message":{"text":"Source: 'request.getCookies()' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java:53'"},"snippet":{"text":"request.getCookies()"},"startColumn":50,"startLine":53}}},"nestingLevel":0},{"location":{"message":{"text":"Propagator : 'theCookies' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java:53'"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java"},"region":{"endColumn":47,"endLine":53,"message":{"text":"Propagator : 'theCookies' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java:53'"},"snippet":{"text":"theCookies"},"startColumn":37,"startLine":53}}},"nestingLevel":0},{"location":{"message":{"text":"Propagator : 'theCookie' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java:57'"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00949.java"},"region":{"endColumn":53,"endLine":5