g into a OutputStream or Writer object. This bypasses any view or template environments, including HTML escaping, which may expose this application to cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerabilities. Consider using a view technology such as JavaServer Faces (JSFs) which automatically escapes HTML views."},"properties":{},"ruleId":"java.lang.security.audit.xss.no-direct-response-writer.no-direct-response-writer"},{"fingerprints":{"matchBasedId/v1":"f01ec5214adba08b01a8519386aec37a2dab232e26edf6bfc0048c497891d831ae8ad9574af940f6de03deecce10f39d72aa0b6b85f5faeac7505ac7482e5499_0"},"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00960.java","uriBaseId":"%SRCROOT%"},"region":{"endColumn":40,"endLine":42,"snippet":{"text":"        response.addCookie(userCookie);"},"startColumn":9,"startLine":42}}}],"message":{"text":"A cookie was detected without setting the 'HttpOnly' flag. The 'HttpOnly' flag for cookies instructs the browser to forbid client-side scripts from reading the cookie. Set the 'HttpOnly' flag by calling 'cookie.setHttpOnly(true);'"},"properties":{},"ruleId":"java.lang.security.audit.cookie-missing-httponly.cookie-missing-httponly"},{"fingerprints":{"matchBasedId/v1":"cb258f68ef9b4eba1866d4b6369dfdfd5378829856b4f2d9bb20626aa986d1de2e19f5285db30bf51479dbe49478f1b5eeba0b74052636ae4213d144b34ea59d_0"},"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest00960.java","uriBaseId":"%SRCROOT%"},"region":{"endColumn":40,"endLine":42,"snippet":{"text":"        response.addCookie(userCookie);"},"startColumn":9,"startLine":42}}}],"message":{"text":"A cookie was detected without setting the 'HttpOnly' flag. The 'HttpOnly' flag for cookies instructs the browser to forbid client-side scripts from reading the cookie. Set the 'HttpOnly' flag by calling 'cookie.setHttpOnly(true);'"},"properties":{},"ruleId":"java.servlets.security.audit.cookie-missing-