 allowing public-facing applications to access only the required files. In Java, you may also consider using a utility method such as `org.apache.commons.io.FilenameUtils.getName(...)` to only retrieve the file name from the path."},"properties":{},"ruleId":"java.servlets.security.httpservlet-path-traversal.httpservlet-path-traversal"},{"codeFlows":[{"message":{"text":"Untrusted dataflow from src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java:43 to src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java:50"},"threadFlows":[{"locations":[{"location":{"message":{"text":"Source: 'request.getParameter(\"BenchmarkTest01231\")' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java:43'"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java"},"region":{"endColumn":66,"endLine":43,"message":{"text":"Source: 'request.getParameter(\"BenchmarkTest01231\")' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java:43'"},"snippet":{"text":"request.getParameter(\"BenchmarkTest01231\")"},"startColumn":24,"startLine":43}}},"nestingLevel":0},{"location":{"message":{"text":"Propagator : 'param' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java:43'"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java"},"region":{"endColumn":21,"endLine":43,"message":{"text":"Propagator : 'param' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java:43'"},"snippet":{"text":"param"},"startColumn":16,"startLine":43}}},"nestingLevel":0},{"location":{"message":{"text":"Propagator : 'bar' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java:46'"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/BenchmarkTest01231.java"},"region":{"endColumn":19,"endLine":46,"message":{"text":"Propagator : 'bar' @ 'src/main/java/org/owasp/benchmark/testcode/